{"tmdb":1061838,"tagline":"","synopsis":"Aboard a ship, back when terrible pirates roamed the seven seas, a child, Mo, grows up with a crew of ragtag seadogs and the ship’s pet… goat. Having grown up into a brave girl, Mo must wrestle with her father’s career of piracy and overcome trials as she seeks to understand the enigma of her origin. Captured by the evil pirate Peg-Leg Olle, Mo bumps into cabin boy Hannes. Together with him, Claas and his motley crew, brave Mo will have to defeat Olle and find the Blood Red Blood Ruby of Doom, to restore peace and harmony to the land. Pirate Mo is a swashbuckling adventure full of heart, guts, and hope for a better world, led by a young girl whose goodness is matched only by her derring-do.","directors":[{"name":"Florian Westermann","id":2163421}],"cast":[{"actor":"Dunja Bernatzky","role":"Königin / Plaudertasche (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5bF2tSt6xAamdrxbNvYBygLtpWI.jpg","tmdb":2478423},{"actor":"Fanny Stapf","role":"Mo (voice)","photo":null,"tmdb":1937815},{"actor":"Otto Jaus","role":"Klaas (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/j9MsZz57TZszEZqraAwa1D245zz.jpg","tmdb":1374262},{"actor":"Dominik Dos-Reis","role":"Hannes (voice)","photo":null,"tmdb":3991412},{"actor":"Patrick Seletzky","role":"Holzbein Olle (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/89NS4Alm1c4ukXPlGTWOKyBeLyR.jpg","tmdb":1882546},{"actor":"Christoph Krutzler","role":"Fiete (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uZbgyG0CuMVBwSKRwR0l5i2UmF6.jpg","tmdb":1497341},{"actor":"Michael Steiger","role":"Marten (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/e8SqLsij4Avs3K2NFZCoTIjaCyk.jpg","tmdb":1481526},{"actor":"Gregor Seberg","role":"Nadel (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tN0ECIVta3CDGFCPQmuNpKTbium.jpg","tmdb":225232},{"actor":"Cesár Sampson","role":"Hinnerk (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/Atuw5SDXUaEyPt7jaHLEQFcPl4V.jpg","tmdb":2560985},{"actor":"Susi Stach","role":"Seescham